    {
      "text": "135",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "We have, $\\theta=2 \\pi n=\\frac{\\left(\\frac{v_{f}^{2}}{r^{2}}-\\frac{v_{1}^{2}}{r^{2}}\\right)}{\\left(2 \\frac{a}{r}\\right)}$\r\n$$\r\nn=\\frac{v_{f}^{2}-v_{i}^{2}}{(2 a r)(2 \\pi)}=95\r\n$$"
  }
